sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant QR as QRCode Library
    participant FS as File System
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Note over A,DB: Tambah Meja Baru + Auto Generate QR

    A->>B: Input nomor meja & tekan "Tambah"
    B->>S: POST /api/tables {nomor_meja}

    S->>S: Middleware auth & adminOnly
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM tables WHERE nomor_meja = ?
    DB-->>S: null (tidak duplikat)

    S->>DB: INSERT INTO tables (nomor_meja)
    DB-->>S: Table created (ID)

    S->>S: Build URL: {CLIENT_URL}/menu/{table.id}
    S->>QR: QRCode.toFile(path, url, options)
    QR->>FS: Simpan qr-meja-{nomor}.png ke uploads/qrcodes/
    S->>DB: UPDATE tables SET qr_code = "qrcodes/qr-meja-{nomor}.png"
    DB-->>S: Updated

    S-->>B: Response 201 {table, menu_url}
    B-->>A: Tampilkan meja baru + QR Code

    Note over A,DB: Regenerate QR Code

    A->>B: Klik "Regenerate QR" pada meja
    B->>S: POST /api/tables/{id}/regenerate-qr

    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM tables WHERE id = ?
    DB-->>S: Table data

    opt QR lama ada
        S->>FS: Hapus file QR lama
    end

    S->>S: Build URL: {CLIENT_URL}/menu/{table.id}
    S->>QR: QRCode.toFile(newPath, url, options)
    QR->>FS: Simpan QR baru
    S->>DB: UPDATE tables SET qr_code = newQrPath

    S-->>B: Response {table, menu_url}
    B-->>A: Tampilkan QR Code baru